userspace-resource-manager (1.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
  * Initial Debian release for userspace-resource-manager
  * Userspace Resource Manager(URM) is a lightweight Userspace
    daemon that monitors system resources and enforces policies using
    Linux kernel interfaces such as cgroups and sysfs.
  * Fix invalid Maintainer field format in debian/control.
  * Always install urm.service to /usr/lib/systemd/system.

